1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:03,151
Some cambium cells stay parenchymatous.

2
00:00:03,151 --> 00:00:09,960
They lay down radial ribbons of living cells running through the wood: the secondary medullary rays.

3
00:00:09,960 --> 00:00:15,143
They carry water and food sideways, across the stem, and store starch.

